      "uid": "zhcn:94cd6b0d14677e50cdb366f2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "白天看到的，那认真的眼神。我不认为如此专注地\r\n思考着什么的孩子，会去做坏事。",
      "source_fingerprint": "382b49e16c8eb1dcc7d1733fe7ca73ec56a75980a5374e8be8b6bd9924bfe98c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
