    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c530e27710f198cac37815a4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "某一天，为了物色签约赛马娘，我去观摩了\r\n还未出道的孩子们的训练。",
      "source_fingerprint": "42049e313039ecce227e5c1b07006a799c85e9f5787b3be09cd5c9a5e1b12503",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
