    {
      "uid": "zhcn:59f3aa9caa05721adf4d2de4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……所以说你才不深究么？　靠着没根据的第一印象，\r\n做出自以为的判断……你跟刚才那警察一个德行啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "87cf3afaf92a9a754cea93e8ea682c9bb5627dd3f0111c18553f0aec5444aa00",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
